n8n Form to Airtable Automation

This project is a simple automation built using n8n.

When a user submits a form, the data is automatically captured and stored in Airtable in real-time.

⚡ Features
Automatic form data collection
Real-time storage in Airtable
No manual work required
💡 Use Case

Perfect for lead collection, customer data management, and simple business automation.
